{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":11,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":224,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1915351,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287586,"Name":"SSpartyof2","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1471557808,"LastPoster":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1915351,"PostDate":1471557808,"PostContent":"I have just gotten engaged and am now considering a destination wedding to either the Dominican,...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samanthadoyle89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.79.228.159","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471556429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SSpartyof2","Id":287586,"Name":"SSpartyof2","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.79.228.159","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8866a4178b253750663b024ce339364","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have just gotten engaged and am now &lt;strong&gt;considering&lt;\/strong&gt; a destination wedding to either the Dominican, Mexico, Costa&amp;nbsp;Rica or the Bahamas. The key factor in the decision to have a destination wedding was&amp;nbsp;pricing. I imagine a typical destination wedding will be more inexpensive then a wedding at home. We anticipate 30-45 people but who knows. We&#039;re thinking early 2018 to give people lots of notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I have a few questions I&#039;d love if someone could give me any insight\/opinions on;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;2) What resorts can&amp;nbsp;accommodate&amp;nbsp;$2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;3) What price range am I actually looking at? I&#039;d love to stay around the $10,000 limit.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915351,"PostDate":1471557808,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have just gotten engaged and am now <strong>considering<\/strong> a destination wedding to either the Dominican, Mexico, Costa\u00a0Rica or the Bahamas. The key factor in the decision to have a destination wedding was\u00a0pricing. I imagine a typical destination wedding will be more inexpensive then a wedding at home. We anticipate 30-45 people but who knows. We're thinking early 2018 to give people lots of notice.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I have a few questions I'd love if someone could give me any insight\/opinions on;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><em>2) What resorts can\u00a0accommodate\u00a0$2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">3) What price range am I actually looking at? I'd love to stay around the $10,000 limit.<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samanthadoyle89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.79.228.159","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471556429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SSpartyof2","Id":287586,"Name":"SSpartyof2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.188.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4b0eb602a101d48230c8ac0e53ce156","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement, SSpartyof2, and Welcome to our forum community!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so partial to our magnificent Mayan Riviera! You&#039;ll see lots of great wedding venue choices in our photo albums here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/riviera-maya-resorts&#039;&gt;Riviera Maya Wedding Story Albums&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These 3 come to mind, so we&#039;ll share some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one - enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/15\/Wedding-Bliss-at-the-Barcelo-Maya-Palace&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Palace Delulxe Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....or this from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/06\/12\/Another-Fantastic-Top-Wedding-at-the-Azul-Fives-Riviera-Maya&#039;&gt;Azul Fives Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and this from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/14\/The-Royal-Playa-del-Carmen-and-Church-of-Nuestra-Senora-del-Carmen&#039;&gt;The Royal Wedding Story Playa del Carmen: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915352,"PostDate":1471558509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement, SSpartyof2, and Welcome to our forum community!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so partial to our magnificent Mayan Riviera! You'll see lots of great wedding venue choices in our photo albums here: <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/riviera-maya-resorts' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Wedding Story Albums<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These 3 come to mind, so we'll share some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/15\/Wedding-Bliss-at-the-Barcelo-Maya-Palace' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Delulxe Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....or this from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/06\/12\/Another-Fantastic-Top-Wedding-at-the-Azul-Fives-Riviera-Maya' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Fives Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and this from <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/14\/The-Royal-Playa-del-Carmen-and-Church-of-Nuestra-Senora-del-Carmen' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The Royal Wedding Story Playa del Carmen: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.124.55.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7136f7fa7291220e282c17f82fd9cb93","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Moments That Matter\" post=\"1915352\" timestamp=\"1471572909\"]\nCongrats on your engagement, SSpartyof2, and Welcome to our forum community!!!\n \nWe&#039;re based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so partial to our magnificent Mayan Riviera! You&#039;ll see lots of great wedding venue choices in our photo albums here: [url=\"http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/riviera-maya-resorts\"]Riviera Maya Wedding Story Albums[\/url]\n \nThese 3 come to mind, so we&#039;ll share some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one - enjoy!!!\n \n....from our [url=\"http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/15\/Wedding-Bliss-at-the-Barcelo-Maya-Palace\"]Barcelo Maya Palace Delulxe Wedding Story Album: [\/url]\n[img]https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg[\/img]\n \n.....or this from our [url=\"http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/06\/12\/Another-Fantastic-Top-Wedding-at-the-Azul-Fives-Riviera-Maya\"]Azul Fives Wedding Story Album:[\/url]\n[img]https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg[\/img]\n \n....and this from [url=\"http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/14\/The-Royal-Playa-del-Carmen-and-Church-of-Nuestra-Senora-del-Carmen\"]The Royal Wedding Story Playa del Carmen: [\/url]\n[img]https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg[\/img]\n \nWishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)[\/quote]Thank you! These resorts look great. Any idea on wedding pricing?","Attachments":[],"Id":1915353,"PostDate":1471560008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Moments That Matter, on 18 August 2016 - 10:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congrats on your engagement, SSpartyof2, and Welcome to our forum community!!!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe're based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so partial to our magnificent Mayan Riviera! You'll see lots of great wedding venue choices in our photo albums here: <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/riviera-maya-resorts' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Wedding Story Albums<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThese 3 come to mind, so we'll share some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one - enjoy!!!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n....from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/15\/Wedding-Bliss-at-the-Barcelo-Maya-Palace' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Delulxe Wedding Story Album: <\/a><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br>\n.....or this from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/06\/12\/Another-Fantastic-Top-Wedding-at-the-Azul-Fives-Riviera-Maya' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Fives Wedding Story Album:<\/a><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b7d467b1295d42d09d0929404d27fc45~\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br>\n....and this from <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/14\/The-Royal-Playa-del-Carmen-and-Church-of-Nuestra-Senora-del-Carmen' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The Royal Wedding Story Playa del Carmen: <\/a><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_397787678523462792a8bd3303cf95cb.\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you! These resorts look great. Any idea on wedding pricing?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samanthadoyle89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.79.228.159","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471556429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SSpartyof2","Id":287586,"Name":"SSpartyof2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.25.17.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"07140aad31cf5039923656aa16cc07d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My advice, you can really make this wedding fit any budget, it would be best to make a list of things you are looking for, (ie: kid friendly, distance, modern rooms vs. beachy, etc). Even just having a couple things on your \"must have\" list (either than price). Will help you narrow down costs.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also note, that when you are interacting with other brides on this board, if they are from the United States they do not typically have the same type of vacation packages that we do in Canada, specifically for all inclusives...so talking pricing may be difficult.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915358,"PostDate":1471610864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your engagement!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My advice, you can really make this wedding fit any budget, it would be best to make a list of things you are looking for, (ie: kid friendly, distance, modern rooms vs. beachy, etc). Even just having a couple things on your \"must have\" list (either than price). Will help you narrow down costs.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also note, that when you are interacting with other brides on this board, if they are from the United States they do not typically have the same type of vacation packages that we do in Canada, specifically for all inclusives...so talking pricing may be difficult.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hmfreeman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.25.17.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447939411,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hmsm","Id":285386,"Name":"hmsm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.169.78.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by SSpartyof2, 19 August 2016 - 04:07 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1471622872,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"504791750eb1ae1f76742dcff1ded435","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hmsm\" post=\"1915358\" timestamp=\"1471625264\"]\nHi!\n\nCongrats on your engagement!\n\nMy advice, you can really make this wedding fit any budget, it would be best to make a list of things you are looking for, (ie: kid friendly, distance, modern rooms vs. beachy, etc). Even just having a couple things on your \"must have\" list (either than price). Will help you narrow down costs.\n\nAlso note, that when you are interacting with other brides on this board, if they are from the United States they do not typically have the same type of vacation packages that we do in Canada, specifically for all inclusives...so talking pricing may be difficult.\n\nHappy planning!!![\/quote]Very true, thanks so much for the reply!\n\nI think a kid friendly resort is an important must have for our guests. \n\nAnother thing we like is a nice beach. I&#039;m an avid snorkeler so it would be great if that was a highlight of wherever we choose.","Attachments":[],"Id":1915360,"PostDate":1471622804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hmsm, on 19 August 2016 - 12:47 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nHi!<br><br>\nCongrats on your engagement!<br><br>\nMy advice, you can really make this wedding fit any budget, it would be best to make a list of things you are looking for, (ie: kid friendly, distance, modern rooms vs. beachy, etc). Even just having a couple things on your \"must have\" list (either than price). Will help you narrow down costs.<br><br>\nAlso note, that when you are interacting with other brides on this board, if they are from the United States they do not typically have the same type of vacation packages that we do in Canada, specifically for all inclusives...so talking pricing may be difficult.<br><br>\nHappy planning!!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nVery true, thanks so much for the reply!<br><br>\nI think a kid friendly resort is an important must have for our guests. <br><br>\nAnother thing we like is a nice beach. I'm an avid snorkeler so it would be great if that was a highlight of wherever we choose.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samanthadoyle89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.79.228.159","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471556429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SSpartyof2","Id":287586,"Name":"SSpartyof2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f610c603d5a9c012f3707f8cb3af160","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hi there!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff66ff;\"&gt;Congratulations on your engagement!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;if you are looking for &amp;nbsp;beach destination wedding, Puerto Vallarta has a distinct and unsurpassable charm.&amp;nbsp;Its beautiful landscapes, tropical climate and small town feel will create the perfect ambiance for your wedding and allow you and your guests to get away from everyday life and enjoy the most memorable experiences.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Since 2006, Adventure Weddings has been&amp;nbsp;recognized as one of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff66ff;\"&gt;world\u2019s leading Destination Wedding companies&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;and Las Caletas is the top wedding location in M\u00e9xico.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Contct us for more information, we will be glad to help you on this beautiful process.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84692]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84565]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84034]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84409]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83820]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915361,"PostDate":1471626082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hi there!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><em><span  style=\"color:#ff66ff\">Congratulations on your engagement!!!<\/span><\/em><\/strong>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\">if you are looking for \u00a0beach destination wedding, Puerto Vallarta has a distinct and unsurpassable charm.\u00a0Its beautiful landscapes, tropical climate and small town feel will create the perfect ambiance for your wedding and allow you and your guests to get away from everyday life and enjoy the most memorable experiences.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Since 2006, Adventure Weddings has been\u00a0recognized as one of the\u00a0<\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff66ff\">world\u2019s leading Destination Wedding companies<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">,\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">and Las Caletas is the top wedding location in M\u00e9xico.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Contct us for more information, we will be glad to help you on this beautiful process.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adventure...gsvallarta.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/84692-wedding-ideas-guestbook-puzzle\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_144065.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Wedding Ideas Guestbook Puzzle'  width='200' height='161'  alt='Wedding Ideas Guestbook Puzzle' id='sml_image_view_84692' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/84565-kt-the-beautiful-caletas-a-perfect-spot\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18167\/sml_gallery_258213_18167_1733811.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='K&T the beautiful caletas a perfect spot'  width='200' height='134'  alt='K&T the beautiful caletas a perfect spot' id='sml_image_view_84565' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/84034-lm-lascaletasweddings-mexican-beach-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18167\/sml_gallery_258213_18167_872969.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='L&M , LasCaletasWeddings- mexican beach wedding'  width='200' height='130'  alt='L&M , LasCaletasWeddings- mexican beach wedding' id='sml_image_view_84034' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/84409-candle-light-at-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_215876.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Candle light at Las Caletas'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Candle light at Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_84409' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/83820-kj-lascaletas-private-beach-ceremony\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_1986952.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='K&J lasCaletas, private beach ceremony'  width='200' height='134'  alt='K&J lasCaletas, private beach ceremony' id='sml_image_view_83820' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.239.252.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Johnsonspartyof2, 20 August 2016 - 08:29 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1471681762,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a61954dccc3b25bfebf13fcc221ba970","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SSpartyof2\" post=\"1915351\" timestamp=\"1471572208\"]\nI have just gotten engaged and am now [b]considering[\/b] a destination wedding to either the Dominican, Mexico, Costa Rica or the Bahamas. The key factor in the decision to have a destination wedding was pricing. I imagine a typical destination wedding will be more inexpensive then a wedding at home. We anticipate 30-45 people but who knows. We&#039;re thinking early 2018 to give people lots of notice. \n\n[font=arial][size=4]I have a few questions I&#039;d love if someone could give me any insight\/opinions on;[\/size][\/font]\n\n\n[b][i][font=arial][size=4]1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada) [\/size][\/font][\/i][\/b]\n\n\n[b][i]2) What resorts can accommodate $2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?[\/i][\/b]\n\n\n[b][i][font=arial][size=4]3) What price range am I actually looking at? I&#039;d love to stay around the $10,000 limit.[\/size][\/font][\/i][\/b]\n\n\nThanks in advance![\/quote]@[member=\"SSpartyof2\"] Welcome!! I am also planning for a 2018 wedding! :) This site is soooo helpful you will find a lot of valuable information on here.\n\nI am in the US so a few of my details will vary due to our locations but I will share what I have come up with so far. \n[size=3][background=rgb(247,247,247)]\n[b][i][font=arial][size=4]1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada) [\/size][\/font][\/i][\/b][\/background][\/size]\n[background=rgb(247,247,247)]\n[color=#800080][b][i]I am using Wright Travel Agency they are fantastic but also locatedin the US. If you do a little more searching on here you will find brides that are also located in Canada and the travel agents companies they have used. If I come across them I will be sure to let you know.[\/i][\/b][\/color][\/background]\n\n[size=3][background=rgb(247,247,247)]\n[b][i]2) What resorts can accommodate $2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?[\/i][\/b][\/background][\/size]\n[size=3][background=rgb(247,247,247)]\n[i][b][color=#800080]I am going to the Now Sapphire Resort in Cancun. Its priced well in my opinion and its a very beautiful resort. I know a few brides from Canada went to this resort with there guests paying from $1500-2000.[\/color][\/b][\/i][\/background][\/size]\n[size=3][background=rgb(247,247,247)]\n[b][i][font=arial][size=4]3) What price range am I actually looking at? I&#039;d love to stay around the $10,000 limit.[\/size][\/font][\/i][\/b][\/background][\/size]\n[background=rgb(247,247,247)]\n[color=#800080][b][i]At this moment I am at around 15,000 for everything total. Its best to make a list of everything important to you and go from there. Now sapphire has there wedding brochures online for you to see. You get a lot for your money at that resort. 10,000 should be doable.[\/i][\/b][\/color][\/background]","Attachments":[],"Id":1915364,"PostDate":1471681674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SSpartyof2, on 18 August 2016 - 10:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have just gotten engaged and am now <strong>considering<\/strong> a destination wedding to either the Dominican, Mexico, Costa\u00a0Rica or the Bahamas. The key factor in the decision to have a destination wedding was\u00a0pricing. I imagine a typical destination wedding will be more inexpensive then a wedding at home. We anticipate 30-45 people but who knows. We're thinking early 2018 to give people lots of notice.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I have a few questions I'd love if someone could give me any insight\/opinions on;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><em>2) What resorts can\u00a0accommodate\u00a0$2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">3) What price range am I actually looking at? I'd love to stay around the $10,000 limit.<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287586\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287586-sspartyof2\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SSpartyof2<\/span><\/a> Welcome!! I am also planning for a 2018 wedding! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> This site is soooo helpful you will find a lot of valuable information on here.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am in the US so a few of my details will vary due to our locations but I will share what I have come up with so far.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span  style=\"color:#800080\"><strong><em>I am using Wright Travel Agency they are fantastic but also locatedin the US. If you do a little more\u00a0searching\u00a0on here you will find brides that are also located in Canada and the travel agents companies they have used. If I come across them I will be sure to let you know.<\/em><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><strong><em>2) What resorts can\u00a0accommodate\u00a0$2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><em><strong><span  style=\"color:#800080\">I am going to the Now Sapphire Resort in Cancun. Its priced well in my opinion and its a very beautiful resort. I know a few brides from Canada went to this resort with there guests paying from $1500-2000.<\/span><\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">3) What price range am I actually looking at? I'd love to stay around the $10,000 limit.<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span  style=\"color:#800080\"><strong><em>At this moment I am at around 15,000 for\u00a0everything\u00a0total. Its best to make a list of everything important to you and go from there. Now sapphire has there wedding brochures online for you to see. You get a lot for your money at that resort. 10,000 should be doable.<\/em><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#ffa07a;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\">#ProjectDreamWedding On A Journey To Our Dream Wedding!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"johnsonspartyof2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.239.253.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1470347711,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287511.jpg?_r=1470362394","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Johnsonspartyof2","Id":287511,"Name":"Johnsonspartyof2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.42.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 20 August 2016 - 12:19 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1471695592,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfc4972cf941cea89391687b8090b810","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great advice hmsm! so much depends on what the wedding couple is looking for and have in their spending plan!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A big plus for destination weddings is the cost savings ~ plus so many other awesome benefits!!! Hope you find the answers to your planning questions, and happy research!!! ...Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_e3cc92c2f9d548789bc66c9f8641b5f3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_e3cc92c2f9d548789bc66c9f8641b5f3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_e3cc92c2f9d548789bc66c9f8641b5f3.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915367,"PostDate":1471695568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great advice hmsm! so much depends on what the wedding couple is looking for and have in their spending plan!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A big plus for destination weddings is the cost savings ~ plus so many other awesome benefits!!! Hope you find the answers to your planning questions, and happy research!!! ...Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_e3cc92c2f9d548789bc66c9f8641b5f3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_e3cc92c2f9d548789bc66c9f8641b5f3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_e3cc92c2f9d548789bc66c9f8641b5f3.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.169.78.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb1085b67a3256c534cdcbf29174649b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Johnsonspartyof2\" post=\"1915364\" timestamp=\"1471696074\"]\n@[member=\"SSpartyof2\"] Welcome!! I am also planning for a 2018 wedding! :) This site is soooo helpful you will find a lot of valuable information on here.\n \nI am in the US so a few of my details will vary due to our locations but I will share what I have come up with so far. \n \n[b][i][font=arial][size=4]1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada) [\/size][\/font][\/i][\/b]\n \n[color=#800080][b][i]I am using Wright Travel Agency they are fantastic but also locatedin the US. If you do a little more searching on here you will find brides that are also located in Canada and the travel agents companies they have used. If I come across them I will be sure to let you know.[\/i][\/b][\/color]\n \n \n[b][i]2) What resorts can accommodate $2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?[\/i][\/b]\n \n[i][b][color=#800080]I am going to the Now Sapphire Resort in Cancun. Its priced well in my opinion and its a very beautiful resort. I know a few brides from Canada went to this resort with there guests paying from $1500-2000.[\/color][\/b][\/i]\n \n[b][i][font=arial][size=4]3) What price range am I actually looking at? I&#039;d love to stay around the $10,000 limit.[\/size][\/font][\/i][\/b]\n \n[color=#800080][b][i]At this moment I am at around 15,000 for everything total. Its best to make a list of everything important to you and go from there. Now sapphire has there wedding brochures online for you to see. You get a lot for your money at that resort. 10,000 should be doable.[\/i][\/b][\/color][\/quote]Thanks for taking the time to give such a thorough reply! I&#039;ve heard great things about the Now resorts.","Attachments":[],"Id":1915368,"PostDate":1471700442,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Johnsonspartyof2, on 20 August 2016 - 08:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287586\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287586-sspartyof2\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SSpartyof2<\/span><\/a> Welcome!! I am also planning for a 2018 wedding! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> This site is soooo helpful you will find a lot of valuable information on here.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI am in the US so a few of my details will vary due to our locations but I will share what I have come up with so far.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">1) Can anyone recommend a travel agent? I am located in Bowmanville, Ontario (Canada)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><span  style=\"color:#800080\"><strong><em>I am using Wright Travel Agency they are fantastic but also locatedin the US. If you do a little more\u00a0searching\u00a0on here you will find brides that are also located in Canada and the travel agents companies they have used. If I come across them I will be sure to let you know.<\/em><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br><strong><em>2) What resorts can\u00a0accommodate\u00a0$2000 or less for my quests, but still be reallllyyy nice?<\/em><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><em><strong><span  style=\"color:#800080\">I am going to the Now Sapphire Resort in Cancun. Its priced well in my opinion and its a very beautiful resort. I know a few brides from Canada went to this resort with there guests paying from $1500-2000.<\/span><\/strong><\/em><br>\n\u00a0<br><strong><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">3) What price range am I actually looking at? I'd love to stay around the $10,000 limit.<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><span  style=\"color:#800080\"><strong><em>At this moment I am at around 15,000 for\u00a0everything\u00a0total. Its best to make a list of everything important to you and go from there. Now sapphire has there wedding brochures online for you to see. You get a lot for your money at that resort. 10,000 should be doable.<\/em><\/strong><\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks for taking the time to give such a thorough reply! I've heard great things about the Now resorts. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samanthadoyle89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.79.228.159","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471556429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SSpartyof2","Id":287586,"Name":"SSpartyof2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.66.68.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdcd11d2526081ddfb5f18e218069a54","RawContent":"A great resort for snorkeling is the Grand Sirenis Riveria Maya where I wed. Don&#039;t even have to leave the resort.  \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1915373,"PostDate":1471729759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                A great resort for snorkeling is the Grand Sirenis Riveria Maya where I wed. Don't even have to leave the resort.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80265","Title":"Helpp! Where Do I Start?","LastPostDate":1471878758},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
